## 1. Design System & Theming

### Color Palette
| Token | Hex | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `--bg-primary` | `#FFFFFF` | Page background |
| `--brand-primary` | `#4C1D95` (Deep Royal Purple) | Headers, active nav states, solid buttons |
| `--accent` | `#6366F1` (Electric Indigo) | Hover states, links, Framer Motion highlight moments |
| `--surface` | `#FAF5FF` (Ghost White/Lavender) | Card backgrounds, subtle section dividers |
| `--dark-section` | `#2E1065` | About page hero, footer, contrast sections |
| `--text-primary` | `#1E1B2E` | Body copy on light backgrounds |
| `--success` | `#16A34A` | Readiness score > 80, completed checklist items |
| `--warning` | `#EA580C` | Readiness score < 80, incomplete items |

### Typography
- **Headings:** Playfair Display or Merriweather — set at `font-bold`/`font-semibold`, generous letter-spacing on hero text for the "formal old-aesthetic" feel.
- **Body/UI:** Inter or Geist — used for all forms, tables, nav, buttons, dashboard copy.
- Type scale: `text-5xl/6xl` hero → `text-3xl` section headers → `text-base` body → `text-sm` meta/labels.

### Motion Tokens (Framer Motion)
- **Page transition:** `initial={{opacity:0,y:10}} animate={{opacity:1,y:0}} transition={{duration:0.4,ease:"easeOut"}}`
- **Card hover:** `whileHover={{scale:1.02}}` + `shadow-lg` transition
- **Nav underline:** shared `layoutId="navUnderline"` for the animated active-link indicator
- **Progress ring / checklist bar:** animate `strokeDashoffset` / width on mount and on value change, not instantly snapping

