## 2. Global Navigation (Navbar)

Sticky, glassmorphism header (`backdrop-blur-md bg-white/80 border-b border-purple-100`) present on every page — this is the central routing hub, same principle as Cake.me's persistent product nav.

- **Left:** Logo → router push to `/`
- **Center:** Home · About · Funding · Mentorship · Networking — animated `layoutId` underline on hover/active
- **Right:** unauthenticated → Login (ghost button) + Sign Up (solid purple button); authenticated (JWT in context) → Profile avatar dropdown (Overview / Settings / Logout)
- Mobile: collapses into a slide-in drawer (Framer Motion `x` translate), hamburger icon, same link set stacked vertically

