## 4. Profile Dashboard — Technical Architecture

### Folder Structure
```
/src
 ├── /components
 │    ├── /profile
 │    │    ├── ProfileLayout.jsx
 │    │    ├── DashboardOverview.jsx
 │    │    └── SecuritySettings.jsx
 ├── /routes
 │    ├── profile.js
 │    └── settings.js
 ├── /models
 │    └── User.js
```

### Frontend Components
**`ProfileLayout.jsx`** — Sidebar wrapper (Overview / Settings / Logout tabs) + right content outlet. Logout clears token from context (never read auth state directly from `localStorage` in components — always through `AuthContext`), redirects via `useNavigate('/login')`. Logout button styled `text-red-600 hover:bg-red-50`.

**`DashboardOverview.jsx`**
- Progress Cards: Checklist Progress (circular ring, e.g. 3/4) + Readiness Score (green if >80, orange if <80).
- Edit Details form: `name`, `category` (select), `businessIdea` (textarea) — controlled inputs, `isLoading` disables submit + shows spinner, toast on success/error. `PUT /api/user/details`.

**`SecuritySettings.jsx`**
- Update Email form with server-side uniqueness check.
- Update Password form: `currentPassword`, `newPassword`, `confirmNewPassword` — client-side blocks submission if `newPassword !== confirmNewPassword` before any network call.

### Backend Routes

**`routes/profile.js`**
- `GET /api/user/me` — JWT-guarded, `User.findById(req.user.id).select('-password')`, returns `name, email, businessDetails, checklistProgress, mentorshipHub`.
- `PUT /api/user/details` — updates `businessDetails.businessIdea` / `businessDetails.category` / `name` via `findByIdAndUpdate` with `{ new: true, runValidators: true }`.

**`routes/settings.js`**
- `PUT /api/user/settings/email` — checks `User.findOne({email})`, returns `400` if taken, else updates.
- `PUT /api/user/settings/password` — 1) find user, 2) `bcrypt.compare(currentPassword, user.password)` → `401` if false, 3) `bcrypt.genSalt(10)`, 4) `bcrypt.hash(newPassword, salt)`, 5) save, return `200`.

### Database Schema (`models/User.js`)
```javascript
const mongoose = require('mongoose');

const UserSchema = new mongoose.Schema({
  name: { type: String, required: true },
  email: { type: String, required: true, unique: true },
  password: { type: String, required: true }, // bcrypt hashed
  businessDetails: {
    businessIdea: { type: String, default: '' },
    category: { type: String, default: '' }
  },
  checklistProgress: {
    completedSteps: { type: Number, default: 0 },
    totalSteps: { type: Number, default: 4 }
  },
  mentorshipHub: {
    readinessScore: { type: Number, default: 0 }
  }
}, { timestamps: true });

module.exports = mongoose.model('User', UserSchema);
```

