## 5. Definition of Done for the UI/UX Layer

A screen is done only when: it uses exclusively design-system tokens (no hardcoded hex/px outside the config), it has all 3 states (loading/empty/populated) built, its motion follows the tokens in §1, and — on both mobile and desktop — it visually reads as "formal, purple-and-white, Cake.me-structured," not as a generic Tailwind template.